# Copy this file to `.env` and set your own value. `.env` is gitignored and
# must never be committed.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL — backend base URL used by `src/config/api.ts`.
#
# The `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix means the value is inlined into the app bundle at
# build time and is therefore PUBLIC. Never place an API key, access token,
# password or any other secret in this file.
#
# On a physical device "localhost" refers to the device itself, not to the
# computer running the dev server. Use the LAN address of that machine there.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5104
